Z||000005||SmokyFalls||06-15-2000||12:32 PM||||Hello Everyone! I'm George's son Dale Miller from North Carolina. Thanks so much for the compliments! I have been very happy with dad's page. His page receives 50-100 hits on a daily basis from all over the world! <P>To A question I read back there, yes I design web sites as one of my jobs. My home page can be viewed at <A HREF="http://www.smokyfalls.com" TARGET=_blank>www.smokyfalls.com</A> <P>With Dad's web site at <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.net" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroshop.net</A>  , I've been trying to place as many resources for any Fiero owner out there. If anyone has a suggestions on what they would like to see, please feel free to E-mail me back!  <P>The newest thing that will be coming out soon, I will be haveing the Fiero Shop's web site give an option where you could view the web site in Spanish or English. I'm hoping this will be a help on our hispanic viewers out there. Plus, I'm currently taking spanish classes right now, so this will be some good practice for me.     :O)<P>Again, thanks for all of the compliments, & if you have any suggestions, or more Fiero pictures or anything else you would like to see posted on the site, drop an E-mail over to me. webmaster@fieroshop.net<P>-Thanks!<P>-Dale Miller<BR>Fiero Shop<BR>Smoky Falls Web Design||||reg||6
